# Who may use which topic on the public broker (#169). Anything not listed is refused, so whoever holds the
# simulator's password can neither read the fleet's telemetry nor end ingest's restart grace.

# Ingest reads every version's telemetry (IngestWorker.TopicFilter) and publishes and reads back its own caught-up
# marker (IngestWorker.CaughtUpTopic, ADR 0005 restart grace).
user ingest
topic read fieldtrack/+/devices/+/telemetry
topic readwrite fieldtrack/ingest/caught-up

# The simulator publishes v1 telemetry (TelemetryPublisher.TopicOf) and nothing else.
user simulator
topic write fieldtrack/v1/devices/+/telemetry
